# Google's official Google Maps logo files must stay byte-for-byte as Google supplied them (policy: never modify the
# logo). Do not normalise their line endings (core.autocrlf would otherwise rewrite them on commit and checkout) and do
# not apply whitespace checks to them (the supplied SVGs contain trailing whitespace). The SHA-256 of each SVG is pinned in
# components/ui/GoogleMapsAttribution.test.tsx.
public/brand/google-maps/** -text -whitespace
